{"data": [{"author_id": "1859075762579795969", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:54:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114264364140376420"], "id": "2114264364140376420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 165, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，\n全国出生人口达792万人，\n出生率为5.63‰，\n自然增长率为-2.41‰。\n2021-2025年，中国年度出生人口数分别是1062万人、956万人、902万人、954万人和792万人。\n新生人口中，男孩占比仍较多，但性别结构出现边际改善。\n2025年，广东省出生人口为100.3万人，", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoliang2027/status/2114264364140376420"}, {"author_id": "1972207865982337025", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:00:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114643302612152622"], "id": "2114643302612152622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国人口这样下去早晚都跌破14亿，据统计25年末中国人口14.0489亿，出生人口只有792万人，既然广东出生人口和结婚人口最多，东北出生人口结婚人口最少，东北人啥情况，都不结婚生小孩?国家得出手了，我之前就建议国家每个家庭每出生一个小孩，奖励3000股中国工商银行股票，持有到18岁，再给他，留给他", "url": "https://x.com/haora43401/status/2114643302612152622"}, {"author_id": "2051952585138143232", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:39:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114260631792800198"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Finding8964/st…", "end": 101, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Finding8964/status/2114041984830849348", "start": 78, "url": "https://t.co/1ufb42p88C"}]}, "id": "2114260631792800198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114041984830849348", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不仅1-9月份的出生人口已经触目惊心\n\n别忘了怀胎要10个月，\n也就是说3月份之后怀孕开始做产检的人数，基本就是明年出生人口的上限！这个数字可能更加刺激😆 https://t.co/1ufb42p88C", "url": "https://x.com/quinnoutlook/status/2114260631792800198"}, {"author_id": "1881643440234201088", "created_at": "2026-10-25T10:05:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114297181821956402"], "id": "2114297181821956402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 200, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年出生人口数据出来了\n\n每出生100个女孩，大约有111个男孩\n\n本来出生人口就在减少，男孩还比女孩多\n\n突然有点替这批男孩子担心了\n\n小时候卷成绩，长大了卷工作\n\n以后找个对象，估计还得继续卷\n\n这一代男孩子，感觉还没出生就开始竞争了", "url": "https://x.com/henryleewant/status/2114297181821956402"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:49:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114338604772388877"], "id": "2114338604772388877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，中国出生人口792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。其中，仅有7个省份2025年人口自然增长率为正，这7个省份位于西部地区和华南地区，分别是西藏、新疆、广东、宁夏、贵州、海南、青海。", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2114338604772388877"}, {"author_id": "1589682940170018816", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:17:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114556968199430195"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 41, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 36, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2114556968199430195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有人说\n\n按照现在每年的出生人口来看，未来将是伊斯兰教的天下？\n\n对吗？@grok", "url": "https://x.com/Tonyrmjr/status/2114556968199430195"}, {"author_id": "2080882539779272704", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:46:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114352980019630528"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jgN9jrIlLS", "end": 51, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/meigubige/status/2114352980019630528/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114352970532085760", "start": 28, "url": "https://t.co/jgN9jrIlLS"}, {"display_url": "x.com/meigubige/stat…", "end": 75, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/meigubige/status/2114352609448566900", "start": 52, "url": "https://t.co/ktKhfiyMzy"}]}, "id": "2114352980019630528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 258, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114352609448566900", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "人口出生率下降太恐怖了，内蒙古年出生人口不足10万了！ https://t.co/jgN9jrIlLS https://t.co/ktKhfiyMzy", "url": "https://x.com/meigubige/status/2114352980019630528"}, {"author_id": "2042160708826083328", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:05:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114191616475004941"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qMg5wh3bG1", "end": 68, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MarcusLoveone/status/2114191616475004941/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114191608702971904", "start": 45, "url": "https://t.co/qMg5wh3bG1"}]}, "id": "2114191616475004941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。 https://t.co/qMg5wh3bG1", "url": "https://x.com/MarcusLoveone/status/2114191616475004941"}, {"author_id": "1857394183839072256", "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:55:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114521173023510545"], "id": "2114521173023510545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人\n\n出生率为5.63%o，自然增长率为-2.41%o。\n\n我4个孩子，贡献不少", "url": "https://x.com/x_deeplink/status/2114521173023510545"}, {"author_id": "1904976024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:12:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114329310790398125"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/w7zJAPPFHb", "end": 59, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/xie_Dl/status/2114329310790398125/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114329296890363904", "start": 36, "url": "https://t.co/w7zJAPPFHb"}]}, "id": "2114329310790398125", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 264, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不懂就问！中国出生人口怎么降得这么厉害？\n\n是因为年轻人都不做爱了吗？ https://t.co/w7zJAPPFHb", "url": "https://x.com/xie_Dl/status/2114329310790398125"}, {"author_id": "1226860918551613451", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:36:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114546569550889031"], "id": "2114546569550889031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "股市崩了，就业率崩了，出生人口也崩了，我的心要碎了！💔\n每天持续下跌真的很无助，仿佛是超速的车轮冲向悬崖的绝望……", "url": "https://x.com/zeromikiy/status/2114546569550889031"}, {"author_id": "861236976216944641", "created_at": "2026-10-25T00:10:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114147529285894529"], "id": "2114147529285894529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 551, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年的人口数据📊\n\n2025年全国出生人口792万人，\n\n出生率为 5.63‰ ，自然增长率为 \n\n-2.41‰ 。  请注意：是千分之\n\n人口下降，势不可挡…", "url": "https://x.com/mecypu/status/2114147529285894529"}, {"author_id": "1708386139659489280", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:01:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114566620081524983", "2114568058392224096", "2114568110670049327"], "id": "2114568110670049327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n广东一年出生100.3万人\n\n相当于全国每8个新生儿里，就有1个出生在广东\n\n全球出生人口走低的当下，广东人还是太能生了", "url": "https://x.com/overTMoonn/status/2114568110670049327"}, {"author_id": "1708386139659489280", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:55:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114566620081524983", "2114568058392224096", "2114568110670049327"], "id": "2114566620081524983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n广东一年出生100.3万人\n\n相当于全世界每8个新生儿里，就有1个出生在广东\n\n全球出生人口走低的当下，广东人还是太能生了", "url": "https://x.com/overTMoonn/status/2114566620081524983"}, {"author_id": "1708386139659489280", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:01:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114566620081524983", "2114568058392224096", "2114568110670049327"], "id": "2114568058392224096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n广东一年出生100.3万人\n\n相当于全锅每8个新生儿里，就有1个出生在广东\n\n全球出生人口走低的当下，广东人还是太能生了", "url": "https://x.com/overTMoonn/status/2114568058392224096"}, {"author_id": "1904976024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T09:48:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114292994203636052"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7TWXhrnJPL", "end": 80, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/xie_Dl/status/2114292994203636052/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114292982157549568", "start": 57, "url": "https://t.co/7TWXhrnJPL"}]}, "id": "2114292994203636052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 223, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "天塌了！中国出生人口暴跌\n\n多地幼儿园改为养老院\n\n马斯克和赵长鹏这些富人不停生\n\n你们为什么不生了？是因为穷吗 https://t.co/7TWXhrnJPL", "url": "https://x.com/xie_Dl/status/2114292994203636052"}, {"author_id": "18800657", "created_at": "2026-10-25T10:29:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114303215051415899"], "id": "2114303215051415899", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 598, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "天塌了！！\n\n我们国家人口马上要跌破14亿了😱\n\n已经好几年死亡人口大于出生人口\n\n大事不好了！！\n\n以后年轻人不够，我们的养老金谁来交？", "url": "https://x.com/chaoxiao/status/2114303215051415899"}, {"author_id": "1921437096688173056", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:26:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114770532834885804"], "id": "2114770532834885804", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 447, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025 年，中国人口又减少了 339 万，总人口只剩 14.05 亿，眼看就要跌破 14 亿了\n\n全年出生人口只有 792 万，自然增长率降到-2.41‰\n\n折腾了几十年，计划生育终于超额完成任务了", "url": "https://x.com/4gU8m/status/2114770532834885804"}, {"author_id": "1669612498465726464", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:03:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114191205882085487"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/yGsafiTO1K", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/gaodibujiao/status/2114191205882085487/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114190995864887296", "start": 86, "url": "https://t.co/yGsafiTO1K"}]}, "id": "2114191205882085487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "31省份2025年人口出生率公布：\n《中国统计年鉴2026》公布的2025年数据显示，全年全国出生人口792万，出生率5.63‰，西藏、广东等9省份出生率超7‰。‌看图： https://t.co/yGsafiTO1K", "url": "https://x.com/gaodibujiao/status/2114191205882085487"}, {"author_id": "1443054868579577857", "created_at": "2026-10-25T08:47:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114277575954665535"], "id": "2114277575954665535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 435, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "人们生存遇到了问题\n\n趋势的威力，不下猛药不可能扭转！\n\n 全国总人口面临跌破14亿 \n2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。", "url": "https://x.com/ViewMing82/status/2114277575954665535"}, {"author_id": "1952737630661357568", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:15:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114616911569002767"], "id": "2114616911569002767", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国人口都快跌破14亿了。\n\n一年少339万人，出生人口只有792万。\n\n以前担心人太多，现在开始担心没人生了。\n\n兄弟们，你们身边这两年结婚生孩子的人，是变多了还是变少了？", "url": "https://x.com/Tai9492Hui/status/2114616911569002767"}, {"author_id": "2108016008552394752", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:58:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114386044863058223"], "id": "2114386044863058223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 209, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年，中国人口又减少了339万，总人口只剩14.05亿，眼看就要跌破14亿了\n\n全年出生人口只有792万，自然增长率降到-2.41‰\n\n折腾了几十年，计划生育终于超额完成任务了", "url": "https://x.com/laobaii/status/2114386044863058223"}, {"author_id": "2022575691817254912", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:17:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114345514624033267"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 13, "start": 0, "tag": "全国总人口面临跌破14亿"}]}, "id": "2114345514624033267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#全国总人口面临跌破14亿？#\n\n2025年末，全国总人口为140489万人，与2024年末的140828万人相比，减少了339万人。2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。", "url": "https://x.com/SzfyApp/status/2114345514624033267"}, {"author_id": "1242318684632145921", "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:24:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114120986836791759"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lIkhiUoyWP", "end": 121, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/sanny32767167/status/2114120986836791759/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114120958017765376", "start": 98, "url": "https://t.co/lIkhiUoyWP"}]}, "id": "2114120986836791759", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 116, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "31省份2025年人口出生率公布\n\n划重点：\n2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰\n这还是习贼共匪自己编出来的数字都是负数！真实情况怕是更恶略！ https://t.co/lIkhiUoyWP", "url": "https://x.com/sanny32767167/status/2114120986836791759"}, {"author_id": "1245552110973976578", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:01:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114326536337944913"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OfmsMlFlJB", "end": 141, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kuritian24/status/2114326536337944913/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114326527425040385", "start": 118, "url": "https://t.co/OfmsMlFlJB"}]}, "id": "2114326536337944913", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年末，全国总人口为140489万人，与2024年末的140828万人相比，减少了339万人。